# Scan artifacts written into the repo root by --json / --md. These are scratch
# output, but `scripts/stamp-build.mjs` treats ANY untracked file as a dirty
# tree, so leaving one here stamps the release `<commit>-dirty` and costs the
# build its reproducible provenance. 0.1.4 shipped that way because of a stray
# base.json.
base.json
head.json
euthynos-report.json
euthynos-report.md

